              Upcoming Events
            </h2>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-brand-blue-container/5 p-8 rounded-xl border border-brand-blue/10"
          >
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-4">
              New York City / Westchester News &amp; Events
            </h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              To become a sponsor or get involved in the NYC-Westchester Region,
              please email SANYS at <a
                class="text-brand-blue font-bold hover:underline"
                href="mailto:nyc@sanys.org">nyc@sanys.org</a
              > or call <span class="font-bold">(646) 896-1938</span>.
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-red font-bold">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined"
                >notification_important</span
              >
              <span>Save the Date!</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:w-2/3 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div
            class="bg-surface-container-low p-8 rounded-xl organic-shadow md:col-span-2"
          >
            <h3
              class="text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-brand-blue"
                >event_repeat</span
              >
              Monthly Regional Meetings
            </h3>
            <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-4">
              Meetings are now happening in-person and over Zoom! Mark your
              calendars for the <strong
                >first Tuesday of every month from 12-2pm</strong
              >.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/20"
          >
            <h4 class="font-bold text-brand-blue mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">location_on</span>
              Join In Person
            </h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Go to the SANYS office at <strong>25 Beaver St., NYC 10004</strong
              >. Please let SANYS know in advance if you plan to go in person,
              and make sure to bring a <strong>photo ID</strong> or else you won’t
              be allowed into the building.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col"
          >
